{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4133, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3896, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4138, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81b82f2ff0bcf0edf0a5f0faf18481b8", "baseline_text": "좋아∈//시작하자고∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よっしゃ！//はじめようぜ！", "pointer_offset": 3900, "unit": "dialogue:04c2d0e43ae33245", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 5233, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f0cff1848144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있다고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//あたいのパイが//ボーナスパイになってるぜ。", "pointer_offset": 3904, "unit": "dialogue:9ecb830715600624", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4224, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f2658144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題だ。//この中の、どれか１組は、//そろえてくれよ。", "pointer_offset": 3908, "unit": "dialogue:a3f304fc1ca8d30b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 5280, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f8e7f362f0c8f0f18144", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//내가 딜러를 맡을게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//あたいが親をやるぜ。", "pointer_offset": 3912, "unit": "dialogue:f592151af0066fae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 5313, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f381432f2ff0e2f0e4f8b2f5f3f0c7f1488144", "baseline_text": "다음은，//대장이 딜러야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は、//隊長が親だぜ。", "pointer_offset": 3916, "unit": "dialogue:751b84a562647c1e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4337, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f372f772816081442f2ff15af16e8143f1f6f1a8f0ccf0b181b8", "baseline_text": "헤헷～．//어때，항복했나∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "へっへ～ん。//どうだ、まいったか！", "pointer_offset": 3920, "unit": "dialogue:1bbc8db74a99c976", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4372, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f0aff2b381b82f2ff1d0f26cf35df0b18144", "baseline_text": "아앗∈//져버렸나．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あーっ！//負けちまったか。", "pointer_offset": 3924, "unit": "dialogue:f3bcdf0b3c6aa035", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4399, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3fb55f0a4f8a4f287f29ef0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "다음엔 지지 않겠다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は負けねぇからな！", "pointer_offset": 3928, "unit": "dialogue:e52e177d89d7b9b8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4420, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f2ce81608143f1cff8f3fdeff5f0f35df0f081442f2ff15af16e8143f0e2f0e481b82f2ff9a9faf9fab8f0a5f8a4f287f0c8f1438148", "baseline_text": "후～，좋은 땀 흘렸네．//어때，대장∈//한 판 더 하지 않을래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふ～、いい汗かいたぜ。//どうだ、隊長！//もいっちょやらねぇか？", "pointer_offset": 3932, "unit": "dialogue:2b8bb22d597e8fc5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4483, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f26af0e2f957f2ddf0ecf0b2f0cff7d12f2ff1c5f36cf0a5f8a4f263f0a8f18481b8", "baseline_text": "다음 상대는 강적이다…//방심하지 말라고∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の相手は強敵だぜ……//油断しないようにな！", "pointer_offset": 3936, "unit": "dialogue:64806d4d71c4f0b8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4528, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3940, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4551, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3944, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4574, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0e2f0e481b82f2ff9a9faf9f2b881432f2ff26af0e2f94bf1e2f8a4f287f0c8f1438148", "baseline_text": "있잖아，대장∈//한 판 더，//상대해 주지 않을래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なぁ、隊長！//もうひと勝負、//つきあってくれねぇか？", "pointer_offset": 3948, "unit": "dialogue:05e74610b63090d9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4627, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef8f1f0b1fabafa85f2c9f2e9f0cff18481b82f2ff0cff2c3f0b9f8f4fb49f1e2f957fa8af1b5f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "그렇게 나올 줄 알았다고∈//다음에도 봐 주는 건 없다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうくると思ったぜ！//次も手加減しねぇからな∈", "pointer_offset": 3952, "unit": "dialogue:0fa5bf73dab7c09d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4674, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f25cf948f25cf14881432f2ff1a9f36cf0a5f276f0af81b82f2ff0cff2c3f8b9fbf4f1a9faf9f2b1f0faf1848144", "baseline_text": "뭐야 뭐야，//한심하잖아∈//다음에 또 한판 붙자고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なんだなんだ、//だらしねぇなぁ！//また対戦してくれよ。", "pointer_offset": 3956, "unit": "dialogue:2f22e54d51b75aed", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT03KANN.SBN", "offset": 4729, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f372f772816081442f2ff15af16e8143f1f6f1a8f0ccf0b181b8", "baseline_text": "헤헷～．//어때，항복했나∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "へっへ～ん。//どうだ、まいったか！", "pointer_offset": 3960, "unit": "dialogue:1bbc8db74a99c976", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
